    "body": "Currently the default language upon first launch is fixed to \"en\". We can do better by choosing the right language based on system locale.\r\n\r\nThis patch takes a further approach, letting one (and the default setting) always follow the system language, without specifying one particular language statically.\r\n\r\nWe also cache `translationInUse` to avoid seaching locales table on each request.\r\n\r\nCloses #623\n\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\n- - -\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/qTox/625)\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\n",
    "changed_files": 62,
    "closed_at": "2026-02-05T19:48:11Z",
