                    "date": "2026-02-05T19:19:52Z",
                    "email": "iphydf@users.noreply.github.com",
                    "name": "iphydf"
                },
                "message": "feat(Settings): Allow \"Auto select\" language\n\nCurrently the default language upon first launch is fixed to \"en\". We\ncan do better by choosing the right language based on the system locale.\n\nThis patch takes a further step, letting one (and the default setting)\nalways follow the system language, without specifying one particular\nlanguage statically.\n\nWe also cache `translationInUse` to avoid seaching the locales table on\neach request.\n\nCloses TokTok/qTox#623",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "257150e0b3a8a1b31d4fc6f9060e7dfc2b620099",
                    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/git/trees/257150e0b3a8a1b31d4fc6f9060e7dfc2b620099"
                },
                "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/git/commits/bfecb4b34a1b4b5e70de6cf6d981880ffbe17efe",
                "verification": {
                    "payload": "tree 257150e0b3a8a1b31d4fc6f9060e7dfc2b620099\nparent 2b8ff7af1fde1d3c8a1cf02c6d3c596b275cc639\nauthor yangfl <yangfl@users.noreply.github.com> 1768803700 +0800\ncommitter iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1770319192 +0000\n\nfeat(Settings): Allow \"Auto select\" language\n\nCurrently the default language upon first launch is fixed to \"en\". We\ncan do better by choosing the right language based on the system locale.\n\nThis patch takes a further step, letting one (and the default setting)\nalways follow the system language, without specifying one particular\nlanguage statically.\n\nWe also cache `translationInUse` to avoid seaching the locales table on\neach request.\n\nCloses TokTok/qTox#623\n",
                    "reason": "valid",
