                "message": "refactor(translator): Remove auto select locale\n\nThe language selection should be done by Settings. Moreover,\nTranslator::translate() is actually never called with empty locale.\n\nRemove that feature to avoid confusion. However, we still keep the\nfallback to \"en\" to maximize compatibility.",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "050752873a0d41c863232e9959bec9a7e85101a9",
                    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/git/trees/050752873a0d41c863232e9959bec9a7e85101a9"
                },
                "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/git/commits/1de1b72ed63fa2f7c5fb5c26dda61e4dddbf4b96",
                "verification": {
                    "payload": "tree 050752873a0d41c863232e9959bec9a7e85101a9\nparent bfecb4b34a1b4b5e70de6cf6d981880ffbe17efe\nauthor yangfl <yangfl@users.noreply.github.com> 1768804535 +0800\ncommitter iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1770319198 +0000\n\nrefactor(translator): Remove auto select locale\n\nThe language selection should be done by Settings. Moreover,\nTranslator::translate() is actually never called with empty locale.\n\nRemove that feature to avoid confusion. However, we still keep the\nfallback to \"en\" to maximize compatibility.\n",
